From e953783b7453e638bf505fdeb2ec838315f61fe4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 15:45:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] FIX keep reviewed patch completion state visible and
 reopenable

Reviewed patch chats keep the completion decision visible in terminal rows, closed chats reopen when later text is sent, and compact rows preserve completion markers while truncating long titles. The controller and UiHarness coverage exercise the completion lifecycle end to end.
